SET UP THE LAB AND MAKE IT WORKING 

*****Both of the machine should be on the host only for the security best practice reason *********


FOR THE KALI 

Git clone https://github.com/Wh0am123/MCP-Kali-Server.git
Cd MCP-Kali-Server
Python3 -m venv .venv
Source .venv/bin/activate 
Pip install -r requirement.txt

To start a server 
Python3 server.py -ip 0.0.0.0 –port 5000


FOR THE WINDOWS 
 
Ssh -L 5000:localhost:5000 kali@383.343.343.4.34

Git cone https://github.com/Wh0am123/MCP-Kali-Server.git
Cd MCP-Kali-Server
Python -m venv .venv
.\.venv\Scripts\activate
Pip install -r requirements.txt 

Python client.py –server http://0.0.0.0:5000
